37094>>>>>    
37094>>>>>    Function IsLoggedIn Returns Boolean
37096>>>>>        String sLoginName
37096>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession bLoggedIn
37096>>>>>        
37096>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37097>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37099>>>>>            Forward Get IsLoggedIn to bLoggedIn
37101>>>>>            Function_Return bLoggedIn
37102>>>>>        End
